    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## Full preprocessing policy\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"**Do not create a 500-volume persistent `.npy` dataset here.**\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"The final architecture uses the `preprocess_patient()` function on demand. Notebook 03 should call it one patient at a time, extract patches, save the patient's patch files, release the volume, and continue to the next patient.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"This keeps the patient-level split intact and avoids a large intermediate full-volume dataset.\\n\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
